<view class="tech-page tech-page--detail"><view class="binding-brand"><view class="binding-brand__icon"><van-icon name="shield-o" size="40px" /></view><view class="tech-title">连接你的维修身份</view><view class="tech-subtitle">使用平台邀请，开启安心修维修工作区</view></view><tech-state wx:if="{{loading}}" loading /><tech-state wx:elif="{{error}}" error title="身份状态暂未同步" description="{{error}}" action="重新读取" bind:retry="load" /><block wx:else><view wx:if="{{binding}}" class="tech-card"><view class="tech-card__title"><van-icon name="{{binding.status==='ACTIVE'?'passed':'clock-o'}}" color="#D34B18" />{{statusText}}</view><view class="tech-row"><text class="tech-row__label">员工姓名</text><text class="tech-row__value">{{binding.staffName}}</text></view><view class="tech-row"><text class="tech-row__label">申请姓名</text><text class="tech-row__value">{{binding.applicantName}}</text></view><view class="tech-row"><text class="tech-row__label">申请电话</text><text class="tech-row__value">{{phoneText}}</text></view><view class="tech-row"><text class="tech-row__label">申请时间</text><text class="tech-row__value">{{appliedText}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{binding.decisionReason}}" class="tech-notice tech-notice--blue">{{binding.decisionReason}}</view><view wx:if="{{binding.status==='PENDING'}}" class="tech-muted">请等待平台核实本人信息，下拉可刷新审核进度。</view></view>
 <view wx:if="{{canApply}}" class="tech-card"><view wx:if="{{!invitationFromLink}}" class="tech-field"><text class="tech-label">平台邀请码<text class="tech-required">*</text></text><input class="tech-input" value="{{code}}" maxlength="43" placeholder="粘贴平台提供的完整邀请码" data-field="code" bindinput="onInput" disabled="{{busy||!!pendingLabel}}" /></view><view class="tech-field"><text class="tech-label">本人姓名<text class="tech-required">*</text></text><input class="tech-input" value="{{name}}" maxlength="64" placeholder="填写用于人工核验的姓名" data-field="name" bindinput="onInput" disabled="{{busy||!!pendingLabel}}" /></view><view class="tech-field"><text class="tech-label">联系电话<text class="tech-required">*</text></text><input class="tech-input" value="{{phone}}" maxlength="20" type="text" placeholder="填写本人联系电话" data-field="phone" bindinput="onInput" disabled="{{busy||!!pendingLabel}}" /></view></view><view class="tech-notice tech-notice--blue"><van-icon name="info-o" /><text>申请信息由本人填写，不代表微信已验证手机号。平台人工核实后开通维修权限。</text></view><view wx:if="{{pendingLabel}}" class="tech-notice">上次申请结果待确认，请使用原申请恢复。</view><view wx:if="{{submitError}}" class="tech-form-error">{{submitError}}</view></block><view wx:if="{{!loading&&!error&&(canApply||pendingLabel||canEnter)}}" class="tech-dock"><button wx:if="{{canEnter&&!pendingLabel}}" class="tech-btn tech-btn--primary" bindtap="onEnter">进入维修工作区</button><button wx:elif="{{canApply||pendingLabel}}" class="tech-btn tech-btn--primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="onMain">{{pendingLabel?'恢复原申请结果':'提交申请，等待人工核实'}}</button></view></view>
